ilter for example you  go to some place a bar and it's a little  bit loud you can put a 6 DB filter in so  it's just gonna make it a little bit  quieter you go to a really loud concert  you can put in other filters that are  gonna make it much quieter a lot of  people don't want to wear earplugs  because it kind of makes the sound worse  at a show its muffled it kills all the  highs these don't these just keep the  exact same sound it is and just makes it  quieter because you can't feel them  they're custom-made for your ear so they  basically put wax  kind of thing in your ear or nowadays is  to do a 3d laser scan of your ear and  then they print them out have earplugs  protect your ears very important you're  not gonna get them back  my next essential is maybe boring for  most people but really essential for me  these two keys  this is my life this is my license keys  to the software I used to produce music  which is Cubase and then this key for  all my plugins all the sounds I use  they're all on this key and thanks to  Apple for removing my use B's I need to  put these in here and then Thank You  Apple I can't put this in my new macbook  anymore because they took them from me  so I need a adapter and then I can put  that into my laptop yeah Apple when you  have a lot of essentials in your life  you need a place to put them for me it's  a Tumi backpack it's actually pretty  simple it actually is a kind of a small  backpack but it fits a lot of things  this one is really good it has a pocket  that's perfect for passports it has a  pocket here that I put my keys in and  Advil for the nicer alcohol back pocket  for your laptop and I would highly  recommend it if you are a person like me  that likes to have things and dedicated  places and if you don't need a ton of  space for I don't know why you travel  with if you just have small stuff that  you want to carry it 45 battery packs  like that then this is a good choice  tissues I use a brand called tempo  they're German I think and they are very  soft but very strong  I thank Kleenex to be super soft but not  very strong but I'm pretty allergic to a  lot of things that grow in the spring in  the summer so I need tissues with me  always especially if I travel to Europe  it's really bad or if I decide to cry  cuz I'm really sad but also really good  for that I don't know if you can get  them in America it's a mess with you I  have a lifetime supply at home so I will  never run out of tempest my Cologne  I wear Chanel allure balm I've been  using the same Cologne since I was maybe  17 16 7  I'm so used to that I can't smell it  myself anymore  I think whatever in my nose is dead  after using this for so long but people  always say that I smell nice and this is  the reason it's not me at that is that a  thing yeah that's right here in there  but not full ones I guess I could just  do two like normal people do but I guess  I feel really extra when I use this this  is we call it hand banana but it's a  neck pillow I've been using this for a  long time as you guys probably know by  now I have a very specific taste and I  stick to the things I like it has the  option to basically straighten it out  and you can put it you know as a pillow  for your lower back and then my dear  hand banana has the feature tightening  it and my secret travel away is making  this as tight as possible it gets  relatively hard window-seat is something  that's essential but I couldn't bring it  with me so just bear that in mind and  then this set leans to the window  and it's magic once I was skydiving I  had a window seat and on the way up I  was just kind of like till I realized I  have to jump out of a plane  my next essential is a laptop charger I  personally use the new MacBook and they  only have used PC so this was a  Kickstarter that I found this side has  the USB see that you put into your phone  but you also have the three used beasts  that Apple stole from your life you get  them back I use the same charger for  both my iPhone and my laptop and if you  need to plug in the USB key to for music  or whatever you can also use this and  it's the exact same size as your regular  Apple charger but you can also hide the  cable in here it's got like a little  pocket so it actually becomes even  smaller and you can detach this so it  just becomes a little little cube like I  I am too because I bought things that I  never received so if you see this and  you've been one of those send it to me  [Music]

